\section{Several outcomes}{

With more than one outcome (or time point) in wide format, outcomes are
placed side by side: one row per study, study details once, and each
outcome's columns suffixed with its \code{outcome_id} (and time point, when an
outcome has several), e.g. \code{outcome_id_hosp_los}, \code{yi_hosp_los},
\code{sei_icu_los}.
Studies that did not report an outcome have empty cells for it. Each
outcome uses its own \code{measure} unless \code{measure} is given. With a single
outcome, columns keep their plain names (\code{yi}, \code{sei}, ...).
